        <object id="f739f5c1-1bc0-4081-8022-c9fb9f9fdb9b" name="[R] Updated Email Branding" xmlns="http://www.blueprism.co.uk/product/process"><process name="[R] Updated Email Branding" version="1.0" bpversion="6.9.0.26970" narrative="" byrefcollection="true" type="object" runmode="Exclusive"><appdef><element name="Application Root"><id>994d9fa9-db9c-49c2-9876-599887b753dc</id><type>Application</type><basetype>Application</basetype><datatype>unknown</datatype><diagnose>False</diagnose></element></appdef><view><camerax>0</camerax><cameray>0</cameray><zoom version="2">1.25</zoom></view><preconditions /><endpoint narrative="" /><subsheet subsheetid="60b199f4-e369-4ed5-8635-7e957f2990e6" type="CleanUp" published="True"><name>Clean Up</name><view><camerax>0</camerax><cameray>0</cameray><zoom version="2">1.25</zoom></view></subsheet><subsheet subsheetid="1055b524-ceab-4b11-8f2c-8e8dd5cc850d" type="Normal" published="False"><name>Email Formatting</name><view><camerax>0</camerax><cameray>0</cameray><zoom version="2">1.25</zoom></view></subsheet><subsheet subsheetid="01b807c7-a636-44bb-b367-2552cc5c5b0f" type="Normal" published="True"><name>Email Formatting - Main</name><view><camerax>6</camerax><cameray>0</cameray><zoom version="2">1.25</zoom></view></subsheet><subsheet subsheetid="01d2386f-ec4a-4b34-a798-c85ccd56af24" type="Normal" published="True"><name>Email Formatting - Main v1.2</name><view><camerax>6</camerax><cameray>50</cameray><zoom version="2">1.25</zoom></view></subsheet><subsheet subsheetid="bb7e612c-abdb-4f02-8dfd-66fdc0074894" type="Normal" published="True"><name>Email Formatting - Main v1.2 - MyContractor use only</name><view><camerax>6</camerax><cameray>50</cameray><zoom version="2">1.25</zoom></view></subsheet><subsheet subsheetid="cf9e4115-0075-41f0-b8d9-1861d1056630" type="Normal" published="False"><name>Send Mail</name><view><camerax>0</camerax><cameray>211</cameray><zoom version="2">1.25</zoom></view></subsheet><stage stageid="41003eae-6535-4496-97c2-3b14fcd887ec" name="Start" type="Start"><loginhibit /><display x="15" y="-105" /><onsuccess>b749ae2b-3ec3-4e09-a296-931b44554781</onsuccess></stage><stage stageid="b749ae2b-3ec3-4e09-a296-931b44554781" name="End" type="End"><loginhibit /><display x="15" y="90" /></stage><stage stageid="b12c2ffe-f07f-428a-9c97-aa0df0563f60" name="Stage1" type="ProcessInfo"><display x="-195" y="-105" w="150" h="90" /><references><reference>System.dll</reference><reference>System.Data.dll</reference><reference>System.Xml.dll</reference><reference>System.Drawing.dll</reference></references><imports><import>System</import><import>System.Drawing</import><import>System.Data</import></imports><language>visualbasic</language><globalcode><![CDATA[]]></globalcode><code><![CDATA[]]></code></stage><stage stageid="38f9be02-4f3e-47ee-afa5-f16f3e8c9c39" name="Clean Up" type="SubSheetInfo"><subsheetid>60b199f4-e369-4ed5-8635-7e957f2990e6</subsheetid><display x="-195" y="-105" w="150" h="90" /></stage><stage stageid="544ec4dc-241e-44bb-827c-e5ecd3fc861e" name="Start" type="Start"><subsheetid>60b199f4-e369-4ed5-8635-7e957f2990e6</subsheetid><loginhibit /><display x="15" y="-105" /><onsuccess>e051470b-d5ac-4cf0-9282-3bf6d0ba243f</onsuccess></stage><stage stageid="e051470b-d5ac-4cf0-9282-3bf6d0ba243f" name="End" type="End"><subsheetid>60b199f4-e369-4ed5-8635-7e957f2990e6</subsheetid><loginhibit /><display x="15" y="90" /></stage><stage stageid="c18d877b-8d92-4b60-821d-87a5ead88a7a" name="Email Formatting" type="SubSheetInfo"><subsheetid>1055b524-ceab-4b11-8f2c-8e8dd5cc850d</subsheetid><display x="-195" y="-105" w="150" h="90" /></stage><stage stageid="3e219937-82ba-4f9b-bca7-3a175a6b7059" name="Start" type="Start"><subsheetid>1055b524-ceab-4b11-8f2c-8e8dd5cc850d</subsheetid><loginhibit /><display x="15" y="-105" /><inputs><input type="text" name="Subject Line" stage="Subject Line" /><input type="text" name="Mail To" stage="Mail To" /><input type="text" name="Body Content" stage="Body Content" /><input type="text" name="Mail From" stage="Mail From" /></inputs><onsuccess>0ed58607-dc29-4504-9f06-686be7203c89</onsuccess></stage><stage stageid="c01d0318-d1da-4bd5-be4b-7d690142df40" name="End" type="End"><subsheetid>1055b524-ceab-4b11-8f2c-8e8dd5cc850d</subsheetid><loginhibit /><display x="15" y="165" /><outputs><output type="text" name="Output Email Branding" stage="Output Data Item" /></outputs></stage><stage stageid="1c04e448-4dfb-4619-be60-19d2adcd4cf4" name="Note1" type="Note"><subsheetid>60b199f4-e369-4ed5-8635-7e957f2990e6</subsheetid><narrative>Clean Up Page

This is an optional page where you might choose to perform some finalisation (or "cleanup") tasks as your business object is closed down.

The cleanup action will be called automatically immediately after closing your business object at the end of a business process.

You will not be able to call this action from a business process, nor will it be called at any other time than before the disposal of the business object.</narrative><display x="-180" y="60" w="180" h="230" /></stage><stage stageid="592f59ad-347e-46a1-84ea-f18f072fb055" name="Note2" type="Note"><narrative>Initialise Page

This is an optional page where you might choose to perform some initialisation tasks after your business object is loaded.

The initialise action will be called automatically immediately after loading your business object.

You will not be able to call this action from a business process, nor will it be called at any other time than after the creation of the object.</narrative><display x="-180" y="60" w="180" h="230" /></stage><stage stageid="2c2cd475-b803-4418-8827-81d5b30104a7" name="Subject Line" type="Data"><subsheetid>1055b524-ceab-4b11-8f2c-8e8dd5cc850d</subsheetid><display x="-255" y="60" /><datatype>text</datatype><initialvalue /><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="e8e01756-8f94-4639-94e5-4eed34e83b17" name="Mail To" type="Data"><subsheetid>1055b524-ceab-4b11-8f2c-8e8dd5cc850d</subsheetid><display x="-195" y="60" /><datatype>text</datatype><initialvalue /><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="eaefc8ce-cb42-49e6-8f77-b297cb442333" name="Mail From" type="Data"><subsheetid>1055b524-ceab-4b11-8f2c-8e8dd5cc850d</subsheetid><display x="-210" y="105" /><datatype>text</datatype><initialvalue /><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="f6e55aaf-b36e-46ac-afaa-ec96da29f73d" name="Body Content" type="Data"><subsheetid>1055b524-ceab-4b11-8f2c-8e8dd5cc850d</subsheetid><display x="-270" y="105" /><datatype>text</datatype><initialvalue /><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="0ed58607-dc29-4504-9f06-686be7203c89" name="Check All Inputs Filled?" type="Decision"><subsheetid>1055b524-ceab-4b11-8f2c-8e8dd5cc850d</subsheetid><loginhibit /><display x="15" y="-60" /><decision expression="[Subject Line] =&quot;&quot;&#xA;OR&#xA;[Mail To]= &quot;&quot;&#xA;OR&#xA;[Body Content] = &quot;&quot;&#xA;OR&#xA;[Mail From] = &quot;&quot;" /><ontrue>0e0acabf-e7e2-4da5-b564-5b328e1d8923</ontrue><onfalse>08856d32-37bb-4c0b-b66a-feaa818ee192</onfalse></stage><stage stageid="0e0acabf-e7e2-4da5-b564-5b328e1d8923" name="SE" type="Exception"><subsheetid>1055b524-ceab-4b11-8f2c-8e8dd5cc850d</subsheetid><display x="120" y="-60" /><exception localized="yes" type="System Exception" detail="&quot;One or more input parameters blank.&quot;" /></stage><stage stageid="08856d32-37bb-4c0b-b66a-feaa818ee192" name="Replace Subject Line" type="Calculation"><subsheetid>1055b524-ceab-4b11-8f2c-8e8dd5cc850d</subsheetid><loginhibit /><display x="15" y="-15" /><onsuccess>1c790390-4092-4020-ac1b-3c9aa8ad19a2</onsuccess><calculation expression="Replace([HTML Code for BT Branding], &quot;Subject&quot;, [Subject Line])" stage="Output Data Item" /></stage><stage stageid="4d1fce19-458e-47d5-82ee-be6312ee06fd" name="HTML Code for BT Branding" type="Data"><subsheetid>1055b524-ceab-4b11-8f2c-8e8dd5cc850d</subsheetid><loginhibit /><display x="-210" y="15" w="210" h="30" /><datatype>text</datatype><initialvalue xml:space="preserve">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang="en"&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
  &lt;meta charset="utf-8"&gt;
  &lt;title&gt;Email Template&lt;/title&gt;
  &lt;style&gt;
    body {
      margin: 0px;
      font-size: 11pt;
      font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif;
      width: 600px;
}
    h1 {
      margin: 11.25pt 0 7.5pt 0;
      font-size: 25pt;
      font-family: "BT Group Headline";
      color: black;
      font-weight: normal;
    }
    div.WordSection1 {
      background-color: #DDDDDD;
      word-wrap: break-word;
    }
    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      height: 50;
    }
    table img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 20;
    }
    
    p {
      margin: 0;
    }
    .footer {
      color: skyblue;
    }
    h2 {
      text-align: left;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: normal;
      color: white;
      padding: 10px 0;
    }

      .container {
  position: relative;
  text-align: center;
  color: white;
}
.centered {
  position: absolute;
  top: 45%;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translate(-15%, -25%);
  &lt;/style&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;
  &lt;div class="WordSection1"&gt;
    &lt;div align="corner"&gt;
      &lt;table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="max-width:495.0pt; border-collapse:collapse"&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td style="background:white;"&gt;
            &lt;img src="https://bt.cirrusmobile.co.uk/WriteableFolder/webPageResources/lobSpecificStyles/CEONewswire/communityBannerImages/oneShotV21/newsletter_default_heading.gif" alt="Email masthead"&gt;
          &lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td style="background:white; padding:0 11.25pt 0 11.25pt; height:30.0pt;"&gt;
            &lt;h1&gt;Subject&lt;/h1&gt;
          &lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td style="background:white; padding:11.25pt; height:30.0pt;"&gt;
            &lt;div align="left"&gt;
              &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'BT Curve';"&gt;Hello To(Firstname),&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;
              &lt;p&gt;BODY&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;
              &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'BT Curve';"&gt;Thanks,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
              &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'BT Curve';"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Robot&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
              &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'BT Curve';"&gt;supported by the &lt;b&gt; Intelligent Automation Control Tower&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
     &lt;td style="background:#1D1D1B; padding:0;"&gt;
          &lt;div class="container"&gt;
          
            &lt;img src="https://bt.cirrusmobile.co.uk/WriteableFolder/webPageResources/lobSpecificStyles/CEONewswire/appImageGallery/BT_Group_Templates_Footer-1.png" alt="BT Group"&gt;
  &lt;div class="centered"&gt;This is an automated email from un-monitored Intelligent Automation mailbox.&lt;br&gt;
                    For any questions or queries, contact the &lt;a class="footer"
                        href="mailto:automation.controltower@bt.com"&gt;Intelligent Automation Control Tower&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
           
          &lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;/table&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;
